################################ Common section ################################

# Git
**/.git*

# NPM — host node_modules hold native binaries built for macOS (argon2), unusable on Linux/musl; the image runs its own npm ci
**/node_modules

# Secrets and their templates
**/.env*

# Vitest
**/*.test.ts

# Docker — BuildKit reads the Dockerfile on its own; no build stage needs it
**/Dockerfile

# VS Code | macOS
.vscode
**/.DS_Store

# Prettier
**/.prettier*

# Claude Code — local config and Prisma-generated skills
**/.claude

##################################### Back #####################################

# Vitest
backend/vitest.config.ts

# REST Client scenarios: they contain test credentials
backend/requests

# Docs
backend/docs
backend/*.md

# Upload feature — User uploads from a local run (UPLOAD_DIR): runtime data, possibly personal
backend/uploads

#################################### Front ####################################

# Quasar build output: a stale local build would mix with the new one
frontend/dist

# Quasar
frontend/.quasar
